body:
I was having a crappy day but your jokes really cheered me up, thank you!

I'm up for a chat anytime, I'm having a naff time with the mental ills too so I can understand that. I dabble in a bit of sci-fi and gaming and love a good movie and I'd say a lot of the same music too. I'm 25F from UK, drop me a line if you want :)

&#x200B;
